ght. But it [backfired].'\nYou say, 'Backfired?'\nSilnik says 'The next thing I knew, I'd been recruited to join their army. I can't even sneak away to escape; whenever I move I get dizzy. It's all because of this blasted illusion! If I could just turn back into a Gnome, I'd be fine, but I don't dare take off my disguise with so many enemies around. Won't you [help] me?'\nYou say, 'I will help'\nSilnik says 'Thank Brell! If you could cause a distraction - maybe rid the fort here of some of its inhabitants? - that might allow me to sneak away unnoticed.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'HO-HO-Help!'.\nSilnik has asked you to slay the inhabitants of the fort so she can finally remove her disguise and return to her friends.\n\n---\n\nSlay the inhabitants of the fort 0/8 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_Kill mobs inside the giant fort._\n_Note: You may need to be inside the giant fort in order to get credit. If you pull mobs outside the fort, then only the first player to aggro the mob will get credit (or no credit will be given at all)._\nSpeak with Silnik 0/1 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_Reward:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
