Information\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Gildorn Icebreath'\nGildorn Icebreath says 'I have heard tales of a couple of adventurers that set out to investigate some sort of disturbance near the old giant fort to the north. That was at least two days ago and nobody has seen them since. Perhaps you can look for them to see what may have [happened]? Perhaps they found something of interest.'\nYou say, 'What happened?'\nGildorn Icebreath says 'You may want to search the outside of the fort first, as entering the fort itself is taking your own life in its hands. Return to me if you find anything.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Indoctrination'.\nGildorn Icebreath would like for you to search for some missing adventurers near the old giant fort in East Wastes. Perhaps they stumbled onto some important information.\n\n---\n\nSee if you can locate the missing adventurers near the giant fort 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_This update is outside the giant fort in the northwest part of the zone (about -1900, 3050, 145)._\nFind the journal near the dead adventurers and return it to Gildorn Icebreath 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_The journal is a ground spawn at the same location._\nSpeak with Gildorn Icebreath 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nYou say, 'Hail, Gildorn Icebreath'\nGildorn Icebreath says ''You found this journal near the bodies of the dead adventurers? Let me take a look at it.' Gildorn peruses the pages for a few moments. 'According to the notes written in this journal, the giant fort has been taken over by a fearsome dragon. This must be Zeixshi-Kar, mentioned on the token you found. It also says that they saw a [Coldain] running from the fort, being chased by several Frost Giants. If we can find this Coldain, perhaps they can clue us in on some more information.'\nYou say, 'A Coldain?'\nGildorn Icebreath says 'The last entry in the journal mentions that the adventurers were planning on helping the Coldain, who fled northwest from the fort. Obviously, they didn't make it that far.'\n\n---\n\nFind the Coldain who was fleeing from the giant fort 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nSpeak with Dirgen 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_Find Dirgen ( map) and hail him. He is in the extreme northwestern part of the zone at about 230, 4900, 400._\nYou say, 'Hail, Dirgen'\nDirgen says 'Please help. . . so sick. . . troops made me eat dust from fear shard. . . Won't last much longer.'\nSpeak with Gildorn Icebreath 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nYou say, 'Hail, Gildorn Icebreath'\nGildorn Icebreath says 'You have found the Coldain? If what he says is true about ingesting dust from the fear shard, then he is in dire trouble. I am afraid the only option we have available to help him would be a local hermit named Welken. Welken is seen as nothing more than a madman, but he is the only shaman I know of right now that might be able to help. Seek him out to the east.'\nSpeak with Welken 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_Welken ( map) is found at /location -9130, -4180, 144 (this is the zone-in: he is behind the purple crystal overlooking the coast)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Welken'\nWelken says 'You are not welcome here. I am thrown out of my clan like garbage, but yet when help is needed I am the one who is supposed to rescue them? I will put aside my differences and try to help Dirgen though. I cannot in good faith let a brother Coldain suffer. If what you say is true, then Dirgen does not have much time left. Some very specific [ingredients] are needed to concoct a cure.'\n\n---\n\nLoot a rabbit's foot from a snow bunny 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nLoot a wooly rhino horn from a wooly rhino 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nLoot some ulthork blubber from an ulthork 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nLoot some partially digested lichen from the stomach of a mammoth 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_Bunnies and mammoths tend to be found in the eastern and southern areas of the zone; rhinos are found in most areas; ulthorks are found in the northern part of the zone (ruins in the north) and in the far southwest._\nGive the rabbit's foot to Welken 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nGive the wooly rhino horn to Welken 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nGive the ulthork blubber to Welken 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nGive the partially digested lichen to Welken 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nSpeak with Welken 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nYou say, 'Hail, Welken'\nWelken takes the ingredients from you and quickly performs a series of rituals and incantations. When he is done, a small vial of putrid-looking liquid is all that's left. 'Take this to Dirgen and have him drink it. It should counteract the effects of the shard.'\n_You receive a Vial of Medicine._\nGive the vial of medicine to Dirgen 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nSpeak with Dirgen 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nYou say, 'Hail, Dirgen'\nDirgen quickly quaffs down the medicine. 'Thank you. I am feeling better. Leave me for now. I must get some rest.'\nSpeak with Gildorn Icebreath 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nYou say, 'Hail, Gildorn Icebreath'\nGildorn Icebreath says 'You were able to save Dirgen? That is good news. Let him rest for a while and then speak with me again. We have much to do.'\n_Rewards:_\n187 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
    },
