      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- East Wastes, Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening [zone=868]\n**Who:**\n- Gildorn Icebreath [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Enchanted Snow [item=106602]\n- Sample of Pure Snow Bunny Blood [item=106419]\n- Seashell of Calming Sounds [item=108364]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Dirgen [ _Quests_]\n- Jorga [npc=41576]\n- Mirlil [npc=41579]\n- Welken [npc=41584]\n- Zebexiban [npc=41586]\n- a snow bunny [npc=41550]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Confronting Your Fears [quest=6030]\n- Defeat Zeixshi-Kar [quest=6031]\n- Raid Expedition: Zeixshi-Kar's Shard [quest=6032]\n- Zeixshi-Kar #1: Scaring Up Some Information [quest=6026]\n- Zeixshi-Kar #2: Indoctrination [quest=6027]\n- Zeixshi-Kar #4: The Sweet Taste of Revenge [quest=6029]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 18:06:35 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is the third task in a series of four. It's a shared task that begins with Gildorn Icebreath ( map) in Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening. He is found at /location -8115, 3160, 147 (outside some Coldain huts that are due south of the entrance to the canyon that leads to Kael Drakkel)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- Completed \"Scaring Up Some Information\"\n\\- Completed \"Indoctrination\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Gildorn Icebreath'\nGildorn Icebreath says 'I think you should go [check] on Dirgen again. He may have some valuable information about Zeixshi-Kar.'\nYou say, 'I will check on him again.'\nGildorn Icebreath says 'Be safe, my friend.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Sacrifice'.\nNow that Dirgen has hopefully recovered, speak with him to see if he has more information on Zeixshi-Kar's army.\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Dirgen 0/1 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_Dirgen ( map) is in the extreme northwestern part of the zone at about 230, 4900, 400._\nYou say, 'Hail, Dirgen'\nDirgen says 'I thank you for saving my life, but perhaps you shouldn't have. I am a coward. My wife Jorga is about to be sacrificed to a powerful being from the Plane of Fear known as, Zebexiban. Zeixshi-Kar hopes that if he sacrifices enough souls to this creature, that Zebexiban will become his ally. I beg of you, please save her. I am too weak to do so myself. Please speak with Welken again. Maybe he knows how to save her.'\nSpeak with Welken 0/1 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_Welken ( map) is found at /location -9130, -4180, 144 (this is the zone-in: he is behind the purple crystal overlooking the coast)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Welken'\nWelken says 'My, my. I have become quite popular for a hermit as of late. What can I do for you now? An exorcism you say? I have performed them in the past, but they are far too dangerous to attempt. I cannot risk an evil spirit corrupting my body and using the knowledge I have for evil. Perhaps you can try to [perform] it however.'\nYou say, 'Perform?'\nWelken says 'You will need to gather a few items that will be used in the ceremony to transfer the victim's soul back into their own body. A sample of pure [snow bunny blood], some [enchanted snow], and a [Seashell of Calming Sounds] will be required.'\nYou say, 'Snow bunny blood?'\nWelken says 'I would imagine that you can get snow bunny blood from snow bunnies. Are you sure you are up to performing this exorcism?'\nYou say, 'Enchanted snow?'\nWelken says 'The Snow Dervishes are made almost entirely of enchanted snow. Kill some of them and perhaps you can get enough snow from them.'\nYou say, 'Seashell of Calming Sounds?'\nWelken says 'Unfortunately the shell may not be as easy to obtain as the other two items are. The shell is guarded by a Siren named, [Mirlil]. She perverts the shell's magic to lull victims into her clutches. I am afraid you will need to try to kill Mirlil to obtain the shell.'\nYou say, 'Mirlil?'\nWelken says 'Mirlil appeared not long after the shard struck. A pirate ship approached the southwest shore and when they tried to leave the ship, Mirlil struck and turned the entire crew into mindless thralls. Find the ship and kill Mirlil to obtain the Shell of Calming Sounds.'\n\n---\n\nLoot a sample of pure snow bunny blood from a snow bunny 0/1 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nLoot some enchanted snow from a snow dervish 0/1 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nDefeat the siren, Mirlil 0/1 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_Mirlil ( map) spawns under a shipwreck in the far southwest part of the zone. She is surrounded by several thralls. (/location -9900, 3850, -90)_\n_Note: Thralls are immune to snare, root, mez, and stun. Mirlil, herself, casts \"Entrancing Silence\" (pull spell)._\nLoot a Seashell of Calming Sounds from the siren 0/1 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Welken 0/1 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nYou say, 'Hail, Welken'\nWelken says 'You survived your encounter with Mirlil I see. Perhaps you are strong enough to perform the exorcism. Let me know when you're [ready to begin].'\nYou say, 'Ready to begin!'\nWelken says 'To perform the exorcism, give Jorga the items you collected. These items will hopefully help to protect her during the violent struggle. Once you have given her the three items, you must then chant the following phrase to her: 'Vesius juluira ornanai'. This should force the creature who is feeding on her soul into our plane of existence.'\n\n---\n\nGive the sample of pure bunny snow to Dirgen's wife, Jorga 0/1 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nGive the enchanted snow to Dirgen's wife, Jorga 0/1 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nGive the seashell of calming sounds to Dirgen's wife, Jorga 0/1 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_Jorga ( map) is located east-northeast of the giant fort (and almost due north of the Ry'Gorr fort) at /location -645, 700, 160._\nTell Jorga: \"Vesius juluira ornanai\" 0/1 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nYou say, 'Vesius Juluira Ornanai'\n_This triggers the spawn of Zebexiban (casts \"Consume Soul\", a self-buff haste/attack/regen)._\nZebexiban does not look pleased that you are trying to interrupt its feeding.\nZebexiban has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nZebexiban's corpse slumps pitifuly to the ground.\nJorga unfortunately did not survive the ritual. Her soul has been completely consumed by Zebexiban.\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Dirgen 0/1 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nYou say, 'Hail, Dirgen'\nDirgen says 'My Jorga did not survive the exorcism, did she? You did what you could, and I am thankful for that. I should have found help sooner, instead of fleeing like a worthless coward. Please go for now and let me mourn. When I have composed myself, speak with me again. Zeixshi-Kar will pay for what he has done.'\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
    },
