      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- East Wastes, Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening [zone=868]\n**Who:**\n- Blacksmith Galrim [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Brittle Dragon-Forged Weapon [item=108436]\n- Corrosive Substance [item=108434]\n- Dragon-Forged Weapon [item=108435]\n- Fear Shardling Crystal [item=107880]\n- Galrim's Smithing Hammer [item=108429]\n- Galrim's Toolbox [item=108430]\n- Sample of Manticore Saliva [item=106587]\n- Sample of Spinechiller Venom [item=108318]\n- Small Cauldron [item=108738]\n- Walrus Tusk [item=108213]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a coldain blacksmith [npc=41524]\n- a crate of weapons [npc=41532]\n- a fear shardling [npc=41493]\n- a manticore [npc=41538]\n- a spinechiller spider [npc=41553]\n- a walrus [npc=41559]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 18:24:24 2012\nModified: Fri Jan 10 07:15:29 2025 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a shared task (1-6 players) that begins with Blacksmith Galrim ( map) in East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening. This is a Coldain located at -8650, 2115, 144 (along the southern coast, a little southeast of the entrance canyon to Kael Drakkel)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No tasks\nYou say, 'Hail, Blacksmith Galrim'\nBlacksmith Galrim says 'Fear not, I am not with Zeixshi-Kar's army. The dragon sent a couple of his goons to try to convince me to forge weapons for them, but I refused. Unfortunately that resulted in them taking away my prized [smithing hammer and tools].'\nYou say, 'Smithing hammer and tools?'\nBlacksmith Galrim says 'I am nothing without my smithing hammer and tools. They are enchanted to help me make exceptionally well-crafted weapons. If you could perhaps [get them back] for me, I would happily reward you.'\nYou say, 'I'll get them back'\nBlacksmith Galrim says 'Unfortunately I do not know where they may be now. Your best bet would be to check some of the huts throughout the tundra that Zeixshi-Kar's forces now use as outposts.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'If I Had My Hammer'.\n_Note: The task has no lock point (can add people until the very last step is completed)._\nGalrim refused to smith weapons for Zeixshi-Kar's army, so the dragon sent some of his goons to steal Galrim's prized smithing hammer and tools. He has asked you to get them back for him.\nFind Galrim's Smithing Hammer and Toolbox. He suggests you search near the huts.\n\n---\n\nFind Galrim's Smithing Hammer 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nFind Galrim's Toolbox 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_These items are looted from coldain blacksmiths (these spawn in and around the Coldain huts in various parts of the zone)._\n_Three known locations are -500, 3150, 149 (in the far northeast); -3300, -4500, 143 (just north of the bridge to Iceclad); and -7900, -2200, 150 (a ways southeast of Sleeper's Tomb)._\nGive Galrim's Smithing Hammer to Blacksmith Galrim 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nGive Galrim's Toolbox to Blacksmith Galrim 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nSpeak with Blacksmith Blacksmith Galrim 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_You receive a Small Cauldron._\nLoot a Sample of Spinechiller Venom 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nLoot a Sample of Manticore Saliva 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nLoot some Walrus Tusks 0/2 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nLoot some Fear Shardling Crystals 0/3 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nCreate the Corrosive Essence and give it to Blacksmith Galrim 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_Combine the above four looted items inside the Small Cauldron to create a Corrosive Substance._\nSpeak with Blacksmith Galrim 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nLoot some Dragon-Forged Weapons from weapon crates 0/4 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_Weapon crates are found inside various Coldain huts around the zone._\nDeliver the Dragon-Forged Weapons to Blacksmith Galrim 0/4 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nSpeak with Blacksmith Galrim 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_You receive 4x Brittle Dragon-Forged weapons._\nPlace the Brittle Dragon-Forged weapons back into the weapon crates 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nSpeak with Blacksmith Galrim 0/1 (East Wastes: Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_Rewards:_\n225 platinum\nExperience (3 AAs)",
