      rewards = {
        { id = 108214, name = "Glowing Page", type = "item" },
        { id = 108516, name = "Mysterious Tome", type = "item" },
      },
      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- East Wastes, Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening [zone=868]\n**Who:**\n- Hurble [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/2**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(Average from 2 ratings)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Glowing Page [item=108214]\n- Mysterious Tome [item=108516]\n**Related Zones:**\n- The Plane of Knowledge [zone=158]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Falmonius [ _Quest_]\n- an animated spell book [npc=41491]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Falmonius #2: Stalking the Shadows [quest=6036]\n- Falmonius #3: Masters of Fear [quest=6037]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 18:27:48 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is the first task in a series of three; a shared task (1-6 players) that begins with a gnome named Hurble ( map) in Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening. It's located at 500, -1715, 145 close to the northern cost in the northeastern part of the zone, nearby a blimp)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No tasks\nYou say, 'Hail, Hurble'\nHurble says 'I don't know what is going on around here, but I could really use your [help].'\nYou say, 'What help?'\nHurble says 'I am the captain of the merchant airship you see behind me. Two days ago I set sail from Erudin on my way to Felwithe with a shipment of spell books. As I approached the Buried Sea, strong winds beset my airship and carried me all the way here, and eventually forced me to make an emergency landing. That is not the [worst part] though.'\nYou say, 'What's the worst part?'\nHurble says 'The shipment of spell books I was carrying have sprung to life! It's the darndest thing I have ever seen! I need someone to [take care] of this mess. My crew fled into the icy wastes once the books started flying around, so I have no one else to help me.'\nYou say, 'I will take care of it'\nHurble says 'Um, something else you may need to know. I may have, um, stolen a particularly powerful spell book from a rather cantankerous wizard. When we crashed here, the other spell books ripped the mysterious tome to shreds, eating some very important pages. I need to get those pages back.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'This Can't Be Good!'.\nHurble was transporting some spell books on his airship when he crashed in the Eastern Wastes. The spell books have come alive and must be dealt with.\nKill animated spell books near the airship wreckage and collect glowing pages.\n\n---\n\nLoot glowing pages from animated spell books 0/6 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nDeliver the glowing pages to Hurble 0/6 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nSpeak with Hurble 0/1 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\n_You receive a Mysterious Tome._\nGive the Mysterious Tome to Falmonius 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\n_Falmonius is located in the Plane of Knowledge at 5, 1110, 34 (library's main floor, across from the elevator, up the ladder)._\nSpeak with Falmonius 0/1 (Plane of Knowledge)\nFalmonius is an Erudite in yellow robes on the top shelf of the PoK library entry tier, right next to a Magician vendor.\nIf people care these days about the quest text being here on the quest page, here it is:\nAfter handing in pages:\nHurble places the pages into the badly tattered spell book and the tome begins to glow. Hurble quickly throws the tome to the ground. 'Um, you may want to stand back.' The tome erupts in purple flames. The flames grow in intensity and a mass of magical energy bursts forth, almost knocking you to the ground. Six motes of light fly from the book and head into various directions further into the Eastern Wastes. Hurble looks worried. 'I don't think that was supposed to happen. I suppose I have no choice, but to tell you what's [really going on].'\nYou say, 'What's really going on?'\nHurble says, 'The truth is that I stole these spell books from my master, Falmonius and when he finds out, he will not be very pleased with me to put it mildly. This particular spell book was used to imprison six very angry shadows that Falmonius captured while in the Plane of Shadow. There must be some sort of mysterious magic here that has animated the spell books. I am afraid I am going to have to ask you to talk to [Falmonius].'\nYou say, 'You want me to be your fall guy with Falmonius?'\nHurble says, 'He is not going to be pleased, but he needs to know what has happened here. I would talk to him, but I am pretty sure he would incinerate me on the spot when he found out what I have done. When he isn't stalking the various planes of existence, he can be found perusing the spell vendors in the Plane of Knowledge. Take the spell book and give it to him. He will know what must be done.'\nAfter handing in book:\nYou say, 'Hail, Falmonius'\nFalmonius's brow furrows as you explain what just took place in the Eastern Wastes. 'Hurble! That idiot! I shall deal with him later. In the meantime it is vital that those shadows be [rebound] to the tome.'\nYou say, 'How would they be rebound?'\nFalmonius says 'From what you have described, those motes of light that escaped the tome are most likely the shadows, escaping their prison. Those shadows must be contained! Gather some adventuring supplies and once you are ready to continue, speak with me again.\n_Rewards:_\n337 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience (3-4% in Level 96 + 4 AAs)\n_NOTE: The Crystal Caverns task \"Stalking the Shadows\" follows this one (given by Falmonius)._",
    },
