And those blasted [giants] could kill a Dwarf, trapsin' aroun' like they own the bloody place!'\nYou say, 'What about the giants?'\nBaffod the Wayward says 'Those blasted giants're everywhere, and dunnae seem to care who they step on. It'd be a right favor if yeh could help me by cutting some of the big lugs down ta size, if yeh get me drift.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Lost Without a Compass'.\nBaffod has asked you to slay some giants, so that he can find his way back to his friends without getting trampled.\n\n---\n\nSlay 10 frost giants 0/10 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nSpeak with Baffod 0/1 (Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening)\nYou say, 'Hail, Baffod the Wayward'\nYour task 'Lost Without a Compass' has been updated.\nBaffod the Wayward shakes your hand with violent enthusiasm, 'Much obliged to ye, friend!'\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
