      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- East Wastes, Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening [zone=868]\n**Who:**\n- Tramric the Pessimistic [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a snow cougar - East Wastes - RoF [npc=41551]\n- a snow dervish [npc=41552]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 18:38:29 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Tramric the Pessimistic ( map) in Zeixshi-Kar's Awakening at /location -5500, -3280, 230 (out in the middle of nowhere and partially obscured by a tree, if you're coming from the north -- this loc is a little ways southwest of the bridge to Iceclad)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Tramric the Pessimistic'\nTramric the Pessimistic says 'Hail?! Here?? Oh dear, and I didn't bring a rain-skin or anything! Do you think it will pass quickly? Maybe I should go find a cave to sit in, and just wait it out. I hope the [others] will be ok if it's going to be a bad storm.'\nYou say, 'Others?'\nTramric the Pessimistic says 'Yes, my party. I left them to scout ahead in the hopes of finding a safe route \\*sigh\\*, but I think we're all [doomed], now.'\nYou say, 'Doomed?'\nTramric the Pessimistic says 'There are snow cougars and snow dervishes everywhere, and now you're telling me a hailstorm is coming. I knew we should never have come here. There's no way we'll [get through] alive.'\nYou say, 'Get through alive?'\nTramric the Pessimistic says 'What's that? You say there'